# Whitelist rather than blacklist: exclude everything first, then include what
# belongs in the build context. That way nothing new slips in later either -
# no vault files, no git history, no private project notes.
*

!mmo_vault
!docker
!mmo_vault.py
!alembic.ini
!requirements.txt

# Application data of a local installation. The container gets its own volume;
# a database or configuration from the developer machine has no business in an
# image - config.toml holds the session secret.
var

# Should a real vault file ever end up in the served directory while
# developing, it must not make it into the image under any circumstances.
mmo_vault/**/*.vault
mmo_vault/**/mmo-vault*.json

# Nothing here is needed at runtime.
mmo_vault/**/__pycache__
